<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nouveau mot de passe — After Travel</title>
    <script>
        (function() {
            const t = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
            document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', t);
        })();
    </script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/templatemo-crypto-style.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/templatemo-crypto-login.css') }}">
    <style>
        .at-auth-page { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; background: var(--bg-primary); font-family: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; }
        .at-card { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px 32px; box-shadow: 0 16px 48px var(--shadow); }
        .at-card h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
        .at-card p { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
        .at-field { margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .at-field label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .at-field input { width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-secondary); color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; }
        .at-field input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent-copper); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.2); }
        .at-field input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }
        .at-btn { width: 100%; margin-top: 8px; padding: 14px; border: none; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent-gradient); color: #1c1c1e; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
        .at-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px var(--shadow); }
        .at-back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--accent-copper-light); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .at-back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="auth-page">
<div class="at-auth-page">
    <div class="at-card">
        <h1>Nouveau mot de passe</h1>
        <p>Choisissez un mot de passe d’au moins 8 caractères, puis confirmez-le.</p>
        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_reset_password', {token: token}) }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('reset_password') }}">
            <div class="at-field">
                <label for="np1">Mot de passe</label>
                <input type="password" id="np1" name="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="••••••••">
            </div>
            <div class="at-field">
                <label for="np2">Confirmation</label>
                <input type="password" id="np2" name="password_confirm" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="••••••••">
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="at-btn">Enregistrer le mot de passe</button>
        </form>
        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="at-back">← Retour à la connexion</a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
